    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Low-grade fibromyxoid sarcoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Low-grade fibromyxoid sarcoma typically lacks atypia. Here, uniform cells with ovoid, somewhat angulated, nuclei and fibrillary cytoplasm are dispersed within moderately collagenous stroma.",
